       </table><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><p style="margin-left:3.333%;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">During the first quarter of FY27, the Company completed the sale of its High Performance and High Visibility inventory and certain intellectual property associated with that inventory for total net cash consideration of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_d1306126-7e00-416d-ab73-3be5e2679c0c" contextRef="C_a9659994-4eba-41af-a3d4-d89d4c603150" name="us-gaap:InventoryNet" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">13.2</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million. The consideration included a $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_95356b29-a697-47de-921c-9e4da04ca34a" contextRef="C_06ca98bd-079e-41ab-8ca3-1d061275cec1" name="lake:EscrowConsiderationReceivable" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1.4</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million escrow receivable recorded in other assets on the condensed consolidated balance sheets. The Company recognized a gain on the sale of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_c1bdad6c-a4b8-4390-b673-544327681bfc" contextRef="C_06ca98bd-079e-41ab-8ca3-1d061275cec1" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentRealizedGainLossOnDisposal" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">6.5</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million.</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><p style="margin-left:3.333%;tab-size:26.66px;font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Cash proceeds received related to the sale of inventory has been reflected as deferred revenue in the condensed consolidated balance sheets as of July 31, 2026</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> due to the Company&#8217;s agreement with the buyer to continue to manufacture and warehouse the associated inventory. Deferred revenue will be recognized in the condensed consolidated statement of operations as the Company manufactures and ships the inventory to the buyer. During the three months ended July 31, 2026, $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_a0f70de7-0211-4a0a-90b6-40e0b57edc4c" contextRef="C_e8dec847-034f-4c39-921e-946f2557c390" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerLiabilityRevenueRecognized" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1.4</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million of previously deferred revenue was recognized and offset against the related inventory writedown with no impact to the condensed consolidated statement of operations.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
